  - speakerName: Patch
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: -6874673969537961856, guid: df2987c3ff729bc479afcc5c5f174e97, type: 3}
    dialogueText: So...
  - speakerName: Patch
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: -6874673969537961856, guid: df2987c3ff729bc479afcc5c5f174e97, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Are you and your siblings hungry?
